  "description": "Mother’s Recipe Upma Instant MixA South Indian specialty prepared using the freshest ingredients & seasoned for your convenience with mother’s magical touch.Ingredients: Semolina (Suji), Cottonseed Oil, Iodized Salt, Sugar, Black Gram Dal (Urad Dal), Onion, Mustard, Green Chilli, Cumin, Curry Leaf, Lemon Powder and Asafoetida.Cooking InstructionsStep 1 – In a medium size vessel, boil 2 ½ Cups (650 ml) of water with 2 tbsp Ghee.Step 2 – Add the entire contents of the Upma Mix & bring to a boil Simmer on medium heat for 4 – 5 mins or till the Upma starts to thicken. Keep stirring continuously.Step 3 – Stop cooking & garnish with chopped coriander leaves & a squeeze of lemon.Mother’s Secret tip: For added taste add boiled vegetables like Carrot, French Beans and Green Peas.Serving Suggestion.: Serve hot with Coconut chutney.",
